# Per-row predictions. The small ones are tracked because they are what the
# confirmatory and transfer claims are computed from. The unseen-sgRNA file is
# 234 MB -- past GitHub's 100 MB hard limit -- and is regenerable from the frozen
# seed with `python -m src.run guide`, so it is excluded. The per-sgRNA metric
# CSVs derived from it are tracked in full.
results/pred_guide.parquet
